From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 122/122] PC5: the steering wheel is its own input mode

A profile's [input] mode = wheel makes the console's wheel the game's G29,
and the game gets no controller, so it never reads the wheel twice. In the
other modes the game doesn't see the wheel. Without a wheel, wheel mode is
xinput mode, so the game can still be played.
